{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01164","headline":"相和歌辞 燕歌行 · 陶翰","name":"相和歌辞 燕歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"请君留楚调，听我吟燕歌。\n家在辽水头，边风意气多。\n出身爲汉将，正值戎未和。\n雪中凌天山，冰上渡交河。\n大小百余战，封侯竟蹉跎。\n归来霸陵下，故旧无相过。\n雄劒委尘匣，空门唯雀罗。\n玉篸还赵女，宝瑟付齐娥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}